{"id":72132,"date":"2026-10-31T22:06:36","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T22:06:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72132"},"modified":"2026-10-31T23:09:34","modified_gmt":"2026-10-31T22:09:34","slug":"sao-silvestre-almada","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-almada\/","title":{"rendered":"X S\u00e3o Silvestre Almada 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">X S\u00e3o Silvestre Almada 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>X S\u00e3o Silvestre Almada 2026<\/strong> (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Almada<\/strong>) realiza-se no dia <strong>12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), ao cair da noite, com partidas e chegadas centradas na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o Batista<\/strong>, em pleno centro de <strong>Almada<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. O evento abre \u00e0s <strong>17:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida dos Pequenotes<\/strong> (destinada aos escal\u00f5es de Bambis e Benjamins), seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> o tiro de partida para a corrida principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> e, logo a seguir, para a prova de <strong>5 km<\/strong> (a correr ou a caminhar).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ambos os tra\u00e7ados principais s\u00e3o circulares e decorrem com tr\u00e2nsito autom\u00f3vel integralmente cortado durante um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de <strong>2 horas<\/strong>. O percurso de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (aberto a maiores de 18 anos) e o de <strong>5 km<\/strong> (aberto a partir de Juvenis, 16 anos) percorrem art\u00e9rias hist\u00f3ricas e panor\u00e2micas da cidade \u2014 incluindo a Avenida Dom Nuno \u00c1lvares Pereira, a Avenida do Cristo Rei, a Rua dos Moinhos, o Pragal (nos 10 km), a Rua Capit\u00e3o Leit\u00e3o e a Rua da Sociedade Incr\u00edvel Almadense \u2014 at\u00e9 ao regresso \u00e0 meta na Pra\u00e7a S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o Batista, contando com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica <strong>MyLaps<\/strong> e abastecimento l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido aos 5 km e na chegada.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Clube de Atletismo Amigos do Parque da Paz<\/strong> e pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva O Mundo da Corrida<\/strong>, com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Almada<\/strong> e das Juntas de Freguesia do concelho, a prova \u00e9 limitada a <strong>1500 participantes<\/strong>. Todos os inscritos recebem t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e trof\u00e9u alusivo \u00e0 prova, funcionando o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais no <strong>Almada Forum<\/strong> (sexta-feira, 11 de dezembro, das 14:30 \u00e0s 20:00) e na <strong>Oficina da Cultura em Almada<\/strong> (no dia da prova, das 10:30 \u00e0s 18:00). Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Almada, Set\u00fabal<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" s